WEBVTT

00:12:27.954 --> 00:12:31.329
or the aspiration
to participatory democracy,

00:12:31.371 --> 00:12:34.537
spread across countries around the world,

00:12:34.537 --> 00:12:38.454
and now, it's time for it
to spread in the workplace.

00:12:38.829 --> 00:12:39.996
Thank you.

00:12:39.996 --> 00:12:41.787
(Applause)